Astronomical algorithms
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The ephemeris math in internal/ephemeris implements the algorithms of Jean
Meeus, "Astronomical Algorithms", 2nd edition (Willmann-Bell, 1998). Each file
names the chapters and numbered formulae it implements, and the series tables
are reproduced from the book.

  Meeus, J. 1998, "Astronomical Algorithms", 2nd ed., Willmann-Bell, Inc.

The Go form of those algorithms was ported from the soniakeys/meeus
implementation, which go-astronomy previously depended on. Corrections were
applied during the port; they are noted at the code that carries them.

  soniakeys/meeus, soniakeys/unit
  https://github.com/soniakeys/meeus
  License: MIT

